@* What an organizer page shows when no season is running: past seasons are opened from the overview instead. *@
<div class="mt-6 max-w-2xl rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-5 ring-1 ring-slate-200" role="status">
    <p class="font-medium text-slate-800">No season is running right now.</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-slate-600">
        <a href="manage/seasons" class="text-advent-700 underline">Create the next season</a> to start working on it, or open a past
        season from the <a href="manage" class="text-advent-700 underline">overview</a>.
    </p>
</div>
